[node name="MarbleTrapdoor" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Lever and trapdoor. Origin is the deck at r 49.4 on the hole's centre bearing (+X out, +Z the way the lap runs); the hole is cut into marble.glb at marble_build.TRAPDOOR_B, so place this only on one of those bearings. Shove beside the lever, or shoot its handle: 0.3 s rattle, both leaves drop into the spiked pit, open 4 s, close, re-arm 10 s after the pull. Move the lever with lever_offset / lever_yaw_degrees."
